Ok, so I finally did it! The only VM entry in the highscore file (though
not in the logfile, I've tried this cross-dressing Valkyrie before.) On
level 3 I found the _only_ altar in the entire main dungeon. Checked my
first amulet for blessed/cursed, found it uncursed, and went through the
rest of the game living up to my character's namesake. Didn't use
conflict (never found the ring), didn't wish for the Yendex card, found
only the one WoW in the whole game, and used it for banal stuff like
levitation boots. Key to this game was finding 5 (five!) separate
ghostpiles, and recovering 4 unused magic markers from them.

