Which brings me to my question about Death's corpse. I read something
somewhere about some fancy effects of sacrificing Death's corpse, but
when I tried to pick up his corpse, he came back, and I didn't kill him
till one AoLS later. By then I was out of AoLS, so I didn't try it
again. So, net.hack.gurus: what _does_ happen when you try to eat Death?
Or tin his corpse? And how do you lug the corpse to the altar?

Now there's a valid use for backing up save files: I should have saved
the game while standing on the altar, restarted, ascended, then I'd
have a savefile in the astral plane to play around with in X mode. Of
course, I'd need a scroll of root password to install it back.

